WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:05.838
The Goblet of Fire.

00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:09.174
Anyone wishing to submit themselves
to the tournament...

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:12.219
...need only write their name
upon a piece of parchment...

00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:15.598
...and throw it in the flame before
this hour on Thursday night.

00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:18.976
Do not do so lightly.

00:00:19.226 --> 00:00:22.938
If chosen, there's no turning back.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:28.027
As from this moment,
the Triwizard Tournament has begun.

00:00:31.739 --> 00:00:34.867
[SHIP CREAKING]

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.002
[DOOR SQUEAKS]

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:56.138
Alastor Moody.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.850
Ex-Auror...

00:01:01.477 --> 00:01:03.979
...Ministry malcontent...

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:06.523
...and your new
Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:11.070
I am here because Dumbledore asked me.
End of story, goodbye, the end.

00:01:11.278 --> 00:01:13.072
Any questions?

00:01:16.158 --> 00:01:18.077
When it comes to the Dark Arts...

00:01:19.286 --> 00:01:22.039
...I believe in a practical approach.

00:01:22.122 --> 00:01:28.045
But first, which of you can tell me
how many Unforgivable Curses there are?

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.798
-Three, sir.
-And they are so named?

00:01:31.048 --> 00:01:34.093
Because they are unforgivable.
The use of any one of them will--

00:01:34.301 --> 00:01:38.430
Will earn you a one-way ticket
to Azkaban, correct.

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:41.308
The Ministry says you're too young
to see what these curses do.

00:01:41.558 --> 00:01:45.020
I say different! You need to know
what you're up against!

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.314
You need to be prepared.

00:01:47.523 --> 00:01:50.025
You need to find another place
to put your chewing gum...

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:52.403
...besides the underside of your desk,
Mr. Finnigan!

00:01:52.569 --> 00:01:55.572
No way. The old codger
can see out the back of his head.

00:01:56.281 --> 00:01:58.117
MOODY:
And hear across classrooms!

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:04.039
So which curse shall we see first?

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:05.290
-Weasley!
-Yes?

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:06.917
Stand.

00:02:10.087 --> 00:02:11.839
Give us a curse.

00:02:12.089 --> 00:02:15.843
Well, my dad did tell me about one.

00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:17.594
The Imperius Curse.

00:02:17.845 --> 00:02:21.140
Oh, yeah, your father
would know all about that.

00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:24.143
Gave the Ministry quite a bit of grief
a few years ago.

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:27.146
Perhaps this will show you why.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.570
[INSECTS BUZZING]

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.155
Hello.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.366
Lovely little beauty.

00:02:39.616 --> 00:02:41.160
[CHITTERING]

00:02:42.578 --> 00:02:44.580
Engorgio.

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.623
Imperio!

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.585
[GASPING AND LAUGHING]

00:02:51.128 --> 00:02:53.380
MOODY:
Don't worry. It's completely harmless.

00:02:59.636 --> 00:03:01.221
If she bites...

00:03:01.889 --> 00:03:03.265
...she's lethal.

00:03:03.515 --> 00:03:05.642
[DRACO CACKLING]

00:03:05.893 --> 00:03:07.644
What are you laughing at?

00:03:09.146 --> 00:03:10.397
Get off!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.651
Talented, isn't she?

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:18.197
What should I have her do next?
Jump out the window?

00:03:20.199 --> 00:03:21.533
Drown herself?

00:03:33.295 --> 00:03:36.632
Scores of witches and wizards
have claimed...

00:03:36.799 --> 00:03:40.803
...that they only did
You-Know-Who's bidding...

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:43.222
...under the influence
of the Imperius Curse.

00:03:43.305 --> 00:03:45.224
But here's the rub:

00:03:45.641 --> 00:03:48.644
How do we sort out the liars?

00:03:51.063 --> 00:03:52.689
Another, another.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.234
Up, up. Come on.

00:03:55.317 --> 00:03:57.027
Longbottom, is it?

00:03:57.569 --> 00:03:59.196
Up.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:05.035
Professor Sprout tells me
you have an aptitude for herbology.

00:04:06.954 --> 00:04:08.580
There's the....

00:04:08.831 --> 00:04:10.707
The Cruciatus Curse.

00:04:10.958 --> 00:04:13.710
Correct, correct. Come, come.

00:04:14.044 --> 00:04:15.587
Particularly nasty.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.425
The torture curse.

00:04:21.426 --> 00:04:22.845
Crucio!

00:04:23.095 --> 00:04:25.264
[SQUEALING]
